{"seq":2,"slug":"urban-geography","title":"大学地理学 — 城市地理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/human-geography/urban-geography","wordCount":2050,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学地理学-城市地理学\">大学地理学 — 城市地理学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>城市地理学研究城市的空间结构、功能分区、发展演化及其与区域的相互关系。全球一半以上的人口居住在城市中，城市既是经济增长的引擎，也是资源消耗和环境压力的集中点。掌握经典的城市内部结构模型（Burgess 同心圆、Hoyt 扇形、Harris-Ullman 多核心）、郊区化与逆城市化动态、巨型城市的治理挑战，以及智慧城市的技术前沿，是理解当代人居环境的关键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>代表学者/理论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同心圆模型</td>\n<td>城市功能区按距CBD远近呈环状分布</td>\n<td>Burgess (1925)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扇形模型</td>\n<td>功能区沿交通线呈扇形扩展</td>\n<td>Hoyt (1939)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多核心模型</td>\n<td>城市有多个功能核心</td>\n<td>Harris &amp; Ullman (1945)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>郊区化</td>\n<td>人口和经济活动从中心城向郊区扩散</td>\n<td>20世纪中后期美国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绅士化</td>\n<td>中产阶级回流内城，改造老旧社区</td>\n<td>Glass (1964)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>智慧城市</td>\n<td>信息技术驱动的城市治理创新</td>\n<td>IBM (2008)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-城市内部结构模型\">一、城市内部结构模型</h3><p>三大经典模型从不同角度解释了城市土地利用的空间组织：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Burgess 同心圆模型 (1925)&quot;&#10;    A1[&quot;CBD&lt;br/&gt;中心商务区&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;过渡带&lt;br/&gt;衰退工业+低收入住宅&quot;]&#10;    A2 --&gt; A3[&quot;工人住宅带&quot;]&#10;    A3 --&gt; A4[&quot;中产住宅带&quot;]&#10;    A4 --&gt; A5[&quot;通勤带&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Burgess 同心圆模型 (1925)\"\n    A1[\"CBD&lt;br/&gt;中心商务区\"] --&gt; A2[\"过渡带&lt;br/&gt;衰退工业+低收入住宅\"]\n    A2 --&gt; A3[\"工人住宅带\"]\n    A3 --&gt; A4[\"中产住宅带\"]\n    A4 --&gt; A5[\"通勤带\"]\n    end</pre><p>Burgess 以 1920 年代的芝加哥为原型，假设城市在均质平原上围绕单一中心扩展，各功能区通过&quot;入侵-演替&quot;（invasion-succession）过程动态调整。该模型的核心逻辑是<strong>地租竞标</strong>：CBD 地价最高，只有高收益商业活动才能负担，住宅功能被逐步推向外围。</p>\n<p>地租竞标（bid-rent）曲线表达了不同土地利用对距市中心距离的敏感度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(d) = R_0 - k \\cdot d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为距市中心 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 处的地租，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为市中心地租，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为距离衰减率。商业的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 值最大（对区位最敏感），住宅次之，农业最小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>核心假设</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同心圆</td>\n<td>均质平原、单一中心</td>\n<td>揭示地租梯度</td>\n<td>忽略交通线和地形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扇形</td>\n<td>交通走廊影响扩展方向</td>\n<td>解释沿路发展</td>\n<td>假设单一中心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多核心</td>\n<td>城市有多个专业化中心</td>\n<td>适用于大城市</td>\n<td>缺乏动态机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-城市体系与中心地理论\">二、城市体系与中心地理论</h3><p>Christaller（1933）的中心地理论解释了城市在区域中的等级分布。核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>门槛（threshold）</strong>：维持某项服务所需的最低市场人口</li>\n<li><strong>服务范围（range）</strong>：消费者愿意前往获取该服务的最大距离</li>\n</ul>\n<p>高等级中心地提供的服务种类多、门槛高、间距大；低等级中心地数量多、间距小。理想状态下形成正六边形市场区的层级嵌套结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;一级中心地&lt;br/&gt;省会城市&lt;br/&gt;全功能服务&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;二级中心地&lt;br/&gt;地级市&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;二级中心地&lt;br/&gt;地级市&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;三级中心地&lt;br/&gt;县城&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;三级中心地&lt;br/&gt;县城&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;三级中心地&lt;br/&gt;县城&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;三级中心地&lt;br/&gt;县城&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"一级中心地&lt;br/&gt;省会城市&lt;br/&gt;全功能服务\"] --&gt; B[\"二级中心地&lt;br/&gt;地级市\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"二级中心地&lt;br/&gt;地级市\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"三级中心地&lt;br/&gt;县城\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"三级中心地&lt;br/&gt;县城\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"三级中心地&lt;br/&gt;县城\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"三级中心地&lt;br/&gt;县城\"]</pre><p>Zipf 的城市规模-序位法则提供了另一个视角：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>q</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_r = \\frac{P_1}{r^q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为排名第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 位城市的人口，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为首位城市人口，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 为指数（理想值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）。首位度（primacy ratio）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_1 / P_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量首位城市的相对优势——发展中国家常表现出高首位度（如曼谷之于泰国），发达国家的城市体系通常更均衡。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-郊区化与逆城市化\">三、郊区化与逆城市化</h3><p>郊区化（suburbanization）是 20 世纪中后期美国城市的主导趋势：廉价汽车、高速公路建设和联邦住房贷款政策推动中产阶级从中心城迁往郊区。这导致了&quot;甜甜圈效应&quot;——中心城人口减少而郊区膨胀。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>驱动因素</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交通革命</td>\n<td>小汽车和高速公路降低通勤成本</td>\n<td>居住地与工作地分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>住房政策</td>\n<td>FHA 贷款优先支持独栋住宅</td>\n<td>郊区低密度蔓延</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>种族因素</td>\n<td>&quot;白人外逃&quot;（white flight）</td>\n<td>中心城贫困化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产业迁移</td>\n<td>企业追随劳动力迁往郊区</td>\n<td>边缘城市出现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>逆城市化（counterurbanization）在 1970 年代出现：部分人口从大都市区迁向小城市和乡村地区，驱动力包括环境偏好、远程工作技术和生活成本差异。COVID-19 疫情加速了这一趋势。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-绅士化\">四、绅士化</h3><p>绅士化（gentrification）是中高收入群体进入内城衰退社区、改造房屋并推高房价的过程。Neil Smith 的&quot;地租差距&quot;（rent gap）理论提供了结构性解释：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>地租差距</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>潜在地租</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>当前地租</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{地租差距} = \\text{潜在地租} - \\text{当前地租}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">地租差距</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">潜在地租</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前地租</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当差距足够大时，投资者和新居民被吸引进入低价值区域。绅士化改善了物质环境但常导致原住民被迫迁出（displacement），引发社会公平争议。</p>\n<p>典型的绅士化演进路径：艺术家入驻 → 咖啡馆和画廊出现 → 媒体关注 → 开发商投资 → 房价飙升 → 原住民外迁。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-巨型城市与城市群\">五、巨型城市与城市群</h3><p>联合国将人口超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 万的城市定义为巨型城市（megacity）。2025 年全球约有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 个巨型城市，多数位于发展中国家。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>巨型城市</th>\n<th>人口（百万）</th>\n<th>国家</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>东京</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>日本</td>\n<td>全球最大都市圈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>德里</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>印度</td>\n<td>增速最快之一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上海</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>29</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 29</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">29</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>全球金融中心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>圣保罗</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 22</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>巴西</td>\n<td>南半球最大城市</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉各斯</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>尼日利亚</td>\n<td>非洲最大城市</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国的城市群（city cluster）战略强调以核心城市带动区域发展：京津冀、长三角、粤港澳大湾区三大城市群贡献了全国约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span> 的 GDP。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-智慧城市\">六、智慧城市</h3><p>智慧城市利用物联网（IoT）、大数据和人工智能优化城市治理。核心系统包括智能交通、智能电网、智慧医疗和数字政务。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用领域</th>\n<th>技术手段</th>\n<th>代表城市</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交通</td>\n<td>实时数据+AI调度</td>\n<td>新加坡</td>\n<td>拥堵减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能源</td>\n<td>智能电网+需求响应</td>\n<td>哥本哈根</td>\n<td>碳排放下降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>视频监控+预测警务</td>\n<td>深圳</td>\n<td>犯罪率下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政务</td>\n<td>数字身份+在线服务</td>\n<td>爱沙尼亚</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99%</span></span></span></span></span> 公共服务在线化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>智慧城市也面临数据隐私、数字鸿沟和技术锁定等风险。批判性视角提醒我们：技术方案不能替代制度创新和公众参与。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>选择一个你熟悉的中国城市，判断其内部结构更符合哪个经典模型（同心圆/扇形/多核心），并说明理由。</li>\n<li>用 Zipf 法则计算：如果中国第一大城市人口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2900</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2900</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2900</span></span></span></span></span> 万，第二大城市理论人口应为多少？实际值与理论值的偏差说明了什么？</li>\n<li>分析北京&quot;通州副中心&quot;建设的城市地理学逻辑——它试图解决什么空间问题？</li>\n<li>绅士化对原住社区的影响是利大于弊还是弊大于利？从空间正义角度进行辩证分析。</li>\n<li>智慧城市建设中，如何平衡效率提升与居民隐私保护？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Pacione, M. <em>Urban Geography: A Global Perspective</em>（第四版）全面覆盖城市地理学的理论与案例。</li>\n<li>周一星《城市地理学》是国内城市地理学的经典中文教材。</li>\n<li>联合国人居署《世界城市报告》每两年发布，提供全球城市化的最新数据。</li>\n<li>Florida, R. <em>The Rise of the Creative Class</em> 讨论了创意阶层对城市空间重构的影响。</li>\n<li>中国住建部&quot;全国城市体检&quot;报告提供国内城市发展状况的定量评估。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>城市地理学从内部结构模型到城市体系理论，从郊区化到智慧城市，构建了理解城市空间的多维框架。经典的 Burgess、Hoyt 和 Harris-Ullman 模型虽各有局限，但其揭示的地租梯度、交通导向和多核心发展逻辑至今有效。在全球城市化持续推进的背景下，巨型城市治理和智慧城市建设成为新的研究前沿。理解城市空间，也就理解了现代社会运行的物质基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学地理学 — 城市地理学","id":"大学地理学-城市地理学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、城市内部结构模型","id":"一-城市内部结构模型"},{"level":3,"text":"二、城市体系与中心地理论","id":"二-城市体系与中心地理论"},{"level":3,"text":"三、郊区化与逆城市化","id":"三-郊区化与逆城市化"},{"level":3,"text":"四、绅士化","id":"四-绅士化"},{"level":3,"text":"五、巨型城市与城市群","id":"五-巨型城市与城市群"},{"level":3,"text":"六、智慧城市","id":"六-智慧城市"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学地理学 — 人口地理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/human-geography/population-geography"},"next":{"title":"大学地理学 — 经济地理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/human-geography/economic-geography"}}